{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 236,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00b0d65ca40304695ddab136",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是天狼星象征！\\n没必要对着比赛絮絮叨叨。安静点好好看着。\\n看着我夺下世界，证明“最强”吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab16cac0c5848b31c66f9ffcc70f88b92c2bed50660bd2aa7dcb89d93b760b72",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4f74fce2c15127c0eb07be4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字是目白阿尔丹。\\n即使这双脚脆弱不堪，我也要骄傲的奔跑下去……\\n哪怕只有一瞬也好，我也想在比赛中大放光彩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7762205e972aa100899d067d84fe23aea8f7e21e7d1540883262af441537c76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f9771c02230fe0cd1083f69",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是八重无敌。\\n作为金刚八重垣流的弟子，我渴望与强者对决的\\n比赛。来吧，堂堂正正的，决胜负！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a37a028cce48dce9afb390a8d6d48c19d46afe6052d920cd620acab27a35c98a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:380c57dac2fce28eea364cbe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是鹤丸刚志！我会以『三冠赛马娘』\\n为目标！总之，先全力——咳唔？！\\n……只、只是被呛到了而已！我超健康的，不用担心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14e7a2fc79a11c70fd296f8fc511711b039ce7339f2db65278775fa2242ccbbb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:837dfc7b8e8a707c06c332be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "…………嘛？到了自我介绍的时间了吗？\\n呼呼，我的名字是目白光明。\\n作为目白家的一员，我会努力的～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b6293f5cb042d73f5e97cade3bad815de02ff5e21a61c3a1e122453704a63a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d97b972db0f8aed2db4f63bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是谋勇兼备。\\n为了严格而温暖地养育着我的故乡……\\n梦想是『成为名留历史的马娘』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f5fba736c983e9355bef23b1e67c716fe9bfd3960db6b3f76b0c31348964c92",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1075"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8266bda1e4fddd8098855a37",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是樱花桂冠。我的目标是，世界。\\n是凯旋门赏！――呵呵，虽然它现在\\n只是个『梦』……但总有一天必会实现",
      "source_fingerprint": "46bf29de9fd639b214fbfb9957190285a72eb166f6b8745fd5ba7f1883ba1884",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1076"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75989776f682a0c16310dca6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好，我叫成田路！\\n为了回应一直支持着我的大家们的期待，\\n我会竭尽全力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78bb59cf9066234d801ca5041df5cb6213055a0accc0aacd5ef8ab9f113e00b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1077"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de0dab531cb01d07ede0f3f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我是也文摄辉。\\n我的目标，是风…比任何事物都要迅速地\\n去追寻自由――我想要成为风",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e0071a56be7b441ed320f79fb25825a42798be13d651bc19e145b9bc173e600",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1969600c6812221497cd02d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是狂怒乐章，非中央所属。\\n是从船桥来的特别留学生。\\n船桥的强大……我一定会展现出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb6c46b1e6d3e0192d3df2b2ccc7afb6e2217fdc4c590b75ed6cd4e4cd00d8b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8bd29c8ea9a36c086cb18c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "所以说请多关照咯～训练员酱♪\\n咱们就一起去寻找那些\\n令人兴奋不已的事情吧ー",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed958925dd3f057cfad2c6dd323323342eee0f019a841fddcde83bc49056625c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d97dff15adbd945ccd5c1e71",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是希望之城ー！\\n比赛的话随时奉陪！我要让你们都叫苦不迭……\\n喂你这家伙！别来摸我啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84bf98e17f5cf1e373e372123f42978fc20acf570c7b4c1dd5e7f4e9f840cd97",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7957d1c6e76a5cfe00f4344b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好，我是北方飞翔！从衣服、化妆、\\n配饰，到持之以恒的努力，\\n请见证我在各方面所磨练出的光辉吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99e98c2884c70aa72b01714aab0ca1e4cf08d12e20a16e1e6f4918eb2450ca66",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b928f1458dd1fd4c0591410c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "――我是吉兆。象征家族对我有恩。\\n作为其中的一员，无论是他们的目的\\n还是给予我的任务――都只需完成便是",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d9ba78583d92bab26e50ac9942b371edcb1f1553e5741c77b338332dc796cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:167c67c1358e01ef460a6bab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "老子的名字叫谷野美酒！所追求的东西是理想的\\n“自己”。我可没打算遮掩现在的“我”。\\n破坏、踹飞——然后向着终焉，前进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63ad2b7c70c15e5b275d099bf05b91ace6c124829628280e5991826b11018362",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1084"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8000bca260849022c06be772",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字是第一红宝石。\\n“成为至高无上的赛马娘”，是我家族的义务。\\n为了履行我身上背负的责任，我会继续向前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cc61781c1b315036d122336fe6c0f147c412c787f1c99740d9bcf325485bb17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1085"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cc3dda86d2201a7a1063a01",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要了解我？那就去草地上吧。\\n关于我…目白高峰的一切都在那里",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bc52af7ca7979dcf3f47b9742e3895bb95f5c73a4e64a8bcb7cde03ceda41e7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1086"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db3c10af4c98705d001802c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是小真。真弓快车。\\n总有一天我会成为世界的吉祥物。\\n请用你的那双眼一直看着我吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "32b8ffb7d15fb14ee16b277e776abfc16eee61eb27d3bf3257b64a2d12e683ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d283a8858523a0d1bcd52f5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是里见皇冠哦。我一定要为里见家夺得荣冠。\\n为此我会做好一切准备，\\n化逆境为力量！敬请期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63e287e730b33c4bfb89f40ce4fa822e290fce6229b1c0e913307e2de501a3a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1088"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87c2196719b45522062eef14",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我是高尚骏逸……\\n是的，我自知有些自不量力。不过……\\n总有一天，我会成为――伟、伟大的……没什么，我会加油的",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b95a0c92ed356e04f3ba4bf82f8f430b8eda493a9cdd3e81d963ba3bb6af8a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1089"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83ffd30697121b5426ba23f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是极峰。\\n不到打破一切成为女王的那一天，\\n我绝不会泄气",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf8ac2fb6a28a8349a51aa6e54f9d5f6550d2e1edb625fefc85c6971d9b25b93",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1090"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d54a61cd4fed842f7e42812",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是强击哦！总有一天，我会到闪闪发光的\\n迪拜，去参加奢华的比赛♪\\n我们一起去吧！就这么决定了哟♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6531240f7f98857b8de6be3522ae0f02c247ba0176283be0377ebff835717b6b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:663fec4f376ab48ce0a88865",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是烈焰快驹哦。\\n好啦好啦，大家别争了。\\n吃点甜食然后努力吧～，大概就这样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d60ce6e662814e2662c6b198ed2a3ee292261cbf70432a4a4cfac4849b4fbc58",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1092"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13ed931b1c4c163e2c682a64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我，是凯斯奇迹。\\n为了报答给予我生命的各位……\\n我一定，会创造奇迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d26bda7148d147f062450e04b42f27e6a6d92af3af9a5cc41f24c1524301e9ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1093"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74b6c36b8004028492a4bf55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是森林宝穴。\\n想跑步的话ー就由我来当你的对手吧。\\n不过，“最强”的宝座我可是不会让出来的ー",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe66ee2a9ca61b32e8243c446a9d632ec37ff1668a02c3388a315c2546c006a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1094"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5fa0c435b7ef819cfce3dbf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是信念。\\n希望能把工作做好。\\n…………请多指教",
      "source_fingerprint": "24dee4e6b9a5d9301ed11a7031618099febe63b70d735ff3533788ab1f4f57b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1095"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc8876e26758a3543bf6792e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "噫哈哈，吾名为莫名其妙！\\n为了一统天下，吾将不择手段。\\n现在就下克上吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f24d068457caa55aabf2e93730643ded3c68ed1991f8f40e683641c834d46fd6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1096"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c9aea2e2f649e9f5598c8c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是爱如往昔……我……\\n不，我并没有什么可说的……\\n即便有，嗯……也只有一些秘密，罢了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e38f1e4b855dad3e538c2ef143dc4d1f6718a6121fbddcc6b9513fc459b93b2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1097"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b5d0d241ba277c8f305d6fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Rickey☆Lucky☆大吉祥☆\\n我是小林历奇哦！我要用风水之力\\n给你带来快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a2fb712a7361ddb75cae8014c75dd8e49e943f48a96681abd92a8b6e0d78ac5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1098"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd947230e87aa55a16778c7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "北港飞来，纸翼候鸟♪\\n我是苫小牧地方偶像，北港火山哦！\\n……唔，是不是应该再与众不同些呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "b719ce80e2e7f541874fdd253fdb688bc50242e240e585d77e88030132c45804",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1099"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4844a56545aee3bd1ecea241",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是奇锐骏。\\n虽然优哉游哉，但我蛮擅长踏踏实实\\n做事的哦。多关照",
      "source_fingerprint": "93950c19b5cdf1216d1e64102bb5b637a622a32112ecc47b8ea7d3d27b969052",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ed4a62b8a6c7ebfc897d16a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "噢噢，我爱着的诸位音乐家啊！\\n同我万籁争鸣一起，\\n今天也奏响旋律吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c45bb5b7bc570a2c6bb5da85b820c7142843eee99359649a313466842fd947b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:916c6952c3e44fa9aa0d663d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的愿望只有一个――那就是获得“最强”之称号！\\n我要成为能留在人们记忆中的赛马娘！\\n为了实现这个目标，必不可少的……没错，就是自我展示！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f5bbae48a93b30498d4eb7851f0ff838f1132b46a737c491ba46047249e33b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50f622d774cbdd8ca09e24f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是葛城王牌，请多指教！\\n如果有梦想就不必胆怯了哦？\\n就由我来打破那些制约人的障壁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "093072ff9cbf5f1edf0a9fe9558b0d50ed22782aa34fb4c57132abe35fa3c64a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ab50fedf6846715335ebf6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "新宇宙我，\\n向你提出友好的“接触”方案。\\n换言之――『请多指教』",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bf4e0391b047cfa89bf2b61584d533e8ccb48e7ded9c2e73db8c6e34cd9290d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fb53c08bad9732f854e67fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好，我是菱钻奇宝。说不出理由，不过我\\n感觉不错，如果能尽力就更好了呢，\\n请多指教～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5b3b1e0059228aa4308f0b3855fff094aac969bf74705b19a6cbaa89de83a0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:674fbb866df3af70067a656e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "开启振奋人心的旅途吧！同你的好友彻夜起舞吧！\\n想要邂逅梦想的Everyone――\\n搭上属于我跳舞城的船来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f1d3bdb60f740625b9c03b7728206fad0ca686562787811f1c9b294dace3332",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:501a4fefdeab559264c4517d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我是大鸣大放。\\n我所追求的不是胜利，而是处于更前方的“最强”。\\n…………就这样",
      "source_fingerprint": "962409a25996c7bca6aeeff65285bc088fe6c4b44d9a5476b89610d00a0d3cd7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cea3f4bcc6cccb938efbec4c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是莱茵力量！继承心意，\\n开拓道路，连接未来。\\n我想要成为这样的后冠赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f433e0a7856710be3253311048037c7bd54d650919d612e431aab4a57ac506a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:343f28e0cc6dfa23229e7508",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的夙愿，是加冕后冠，\\n令其成为我光辉未来的基石。\\n――还请你多多指教哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "16c0a15d855528a6d21ea77aa8ff81b02998392a2ef09a53ce463df465a5741a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cc7e5cfa1c29a43c16c871a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目标是成为强大又华丽……像母亲那样的马娘\\n空中救主——传承之伟大，\\n未来相连之尊贵，就由我来证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b3c67bb4338b65036ee000c62d0672ea7fbe754966d30c66872d915d1794ee0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:593538081e6f3fdb999334c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Follow my lead! 敬请期待哦。\\n后冠之光辉定会降临到我身上。\\n我就是未来的女王・勇敢之心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "633397a487b53a140491133b988592216dcc49d708f7b6e15eafa367f82fb3f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:817094d7198798c5e3076ec8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是房一潘多拉酱～♡  \\n我真的超级天才，完全不用操心哦♡  \\n所～以～，那种根性训练什么的就免了吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "a845030dd62fd1b439cf77134a96b6f8e6a11099eea9497d6040e5b1a84bc88b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cd16e12233d8bc16a33758c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是迷人景致。我的梦想，就是兑现约定。\\n――我要抵达那“绝景”。\\n请多关照，训练员！……呵呵",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9e5a740041e088c03b4b5b935359a6c80fda8a2348e59f0f2fbe39b417241db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1573a1685e8aca3dd5140820",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不敬，速跪。\\n――面对吾黄金巨匠之霸道，\\n虔诚顺服为宜",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7f44389d84ed456ea62a35da9ad8e2eeec1e4e349395bcd3af15a5a7eba845f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96e7da0808636b9a665d0176",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过程和理论什么的，全都没有意义。\\n胜者就是正义，不对吗？\\n我贵妇人，会让一切屈服于我的",
      "source_fingerprint": "08c16ffdba4f6330cebf1a2d9369a70ca2b51b41e7ddf369d3feb469f3ade12b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bd75ea8fb6f7726cb518e03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是凯旋芭蕾。主角……\\n想要成为主角只有不断努力！\\n虽然身边都是很强的家伙我也不会气馁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e77e9ba4dceb22fb2a09443cc67b7bad5ec082ab41f97daefca2399a2f37d8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe0df75d38c708d2c28e6292",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是爱慕律动。\\n甜美和温柔，对我来说都没有必要。\\n我只想提升自己……仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29c53170539fc3b665653688cbde7e15cd1132f024e168a574da0a957935fe5a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06e1af24f54b0f40b46f1f1f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要是想商量有关远征的问题，可以找我梦之旅……\\n就让我们一起踏上梦幻般的旅途吧。\\n在我看来你配得上拥有",
      "source_fingerprint": "862cfe05ee453c25350696b7431d935b1bdf4151d72375a02aa21503f220afa9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea220398c6cd4ab19d2ec99d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "金镇之光。\\n梦想是刷新最高速。喜欢直线。\\n完毕。自我介绍我也要最快",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f5bf8809ba50ff731be5f225bea8e8f819293c675d2798d67e473ffcebb0906",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e178ef0faae33989b1fd2d05",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的圣剑将散发疾速的光辉，\\n斩除一切不忠于您的黑暗！\\n我是多旺达，维护誓言与忠义的骑士！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1557cedf1b9a2fc8edda9bbdbcb016e3776d2427242ab3d150b4c64b573ad86a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbfddbe42484bdee3304606c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我有一项宣言。『身为冲锋队长，\\n我要掀起属于四天王的旋风！』\\n我们一起，让梦想膨胀起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68931b368e7efec87a936ec9f57c0c5105664ed1a9b017f6272487dc769ed095",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f4874e8e31a53efb35680af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是樱花千岁王。……哦呀，您的脸色？\\n可以的话，不妨调整一下饮食吧。\\n气血水的调和，正是每日活力的源泉",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d74aa6d3ef05aca2c22a0715e1d354de0be9b29418ce828674d68dfe02bec45",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43c722d7a925fd3b9f17bb9c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈！本官是超常骏骥，\\n中央特雷森学园所属！\\n为做孩子们的榜样，我愿粉身碎骨！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5db8e9eec92a8850187f6b5273b5c5a0172120da0ea38d94b95d01ab3b6068d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d608bb64d108eb04dd81ddb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是防爆装束哦！\\n人类很温柔，所以我最最最喜欢了！\\n很想多多接触，和大家友好相处！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98373807ad2c607ecf1225ad4e88eb0a0f7e4e61da7a42e191cda01a3ff49785",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1128"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d492c43375fc344825616b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是杏目。\\n就算对手是传奇，我也要获胜。\\n不是别人，而是自己，我始终如此坚信！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aa1a65fafc7655aa79283dd93ec5bde6590d45c307b65c82a64de280bc31f2a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ae635d405fe877a9c17e375",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是旺紫丁。\\n以草地之星为目标，任何考验都能忍受。\\n请多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cff50997df1d1c5ac1765dfc49fa3c53f05740202ba76697c3e6f53d00595a62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec34efee253c4a588e4612c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在，我是放声欢呼！\\n0.75英里也好，1.25英里也好\\n未来的英里女王都不会输！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4201f4f47cfa0e0412d4d1c46dd04e017738dcc95e78eb707872570a0bf0dea7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26ae10eec304faab74f1fc29",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是唯独爱你♪\\n我的爱【Love】不是单向而是双向的！\\n让我们用直播把它传播到世界各地吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fd473f7738452d42e02515fb4ac513eff55426c1ae9b7fdf1a5bf9043546956",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10cb3fb3dfbf3b301d902c02",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是创世驹。\\n喜欢探究赛跑史……\\n想要在历史上刻下自己的足迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99832f6ccba1b8037d63480ade81bd3a49109066a7fcac301063ea6c6ec0c78a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8da203447281521ea6eaa8b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是机伶金花。喜欢的东西是\\n把花儿漂亮地装饰起来。还有，我想想啊……\\n争斗之类的——我不太擅长呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c18dc4a8ff6a07cfb1f50e700048168807eba0512ff5bc88a8890d6396a4b84",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:587c204dd87e93a9dacdbf52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请多关照，我是黄金旅程。\\n来吧，让我们享受一段愉快的旅程！\\n随心所欲地踏上黄金之旅吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "656cb5da1f5cff0104b3a83714a71f773a404658a3b9cf171b613098b03ff379",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69faf7dd543501531eea9fdb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字是红色梦想。\\n前方的路，是一望无际的试炼，\\n为了成为真正的圣女，我会将其全部征服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b6969829434b47dbdb8a5c0899145248f4df4a9ae79dd1e9b2623a404dbe182",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1136"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cac50a6cb62de37ee2cdaf8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是神业！艰苦的修行，炽热的友情，\\n戏剧性的胜利！在这样的赛场世界里，\\n我一定会成为主角！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ac266147bd666cb6624f27c801ff33e0e93123053e493587e5ce36fcdaf651c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d512c4dd7e383ae7c06a5dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Hi!　我是青春永驻哦！\\n路线图准备完毕！要在赛马娘界\\n掀起一场革新，不是吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aa147952c7b9f454db3926a587a2386644719388d79e2fbd9d4251a8fe298d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1138"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f92a9396804feb6e3e33933d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是夺金旅途。无论是多高的顶点，\\n只要踏出脚步就都能接近。我有\\n给你勇气的资质，哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "32f9d5a74548c67f41fc8d37ce2c4a8aee252e4a4e1c0fddda094de8d2bb4536",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1139"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3711c5deba2a98d1fe5cd105",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊、那个……就是——『你好☆\n我是洛林酱哦♪我会和青梅竹马的唯爱酱\n一起，好好加油哦☆』",
      "source_fingerprint": "459304e453d77960545f69387f2a964d440fc148985d69a31c7bb489834f7053",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1140"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62964375fbc4a0b58ac69af2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是神威启示！伴随着『命运之声』的\n祝福，让我引领大家走向幸福吧！\n将命运传播至宇宙的尽头！就是现在！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0f4305ad5ed9cc2b6067359d0da51fe61506a3a8f6c109287b9b4751ed8d1b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0cccf0f63ef24208209a4b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是比萨胜驹。为了不让别人感到“孤单”，\\n为了让世界与希望之轮连结在一起。\\n就用我的奔跑来实现",
      "source_fingerprint": "3449ee1db91bdc482fe46782c19a3358a2fafae67cc9603815ce773e7a1c7889",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1143"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a43a1a91c37fe7108bec7a56",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "玫瑰帝国。既是蔷薇一族的\\n一员，亦是实现那一夙愿之人。\\n……我很期待你能助我一臂之力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6146c44f8276e085a50b674cae28d70d94ffde5c19daad54670380d63440a4d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1144"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:995d8b90981803a1f185d976",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是统治地位。凭借我这完美的\\n战略，我将华丽地支配\\n闪耀系列赛这局棋盘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f081b1f6aab47417d62be3482e4f5cb37d8da4769ea1c2c5b23aa87327abc65e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1145"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb00bee6fc6536389e1377d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是蝴蝶兰。降临于身的\\n逆境与不幸，何足畏惧。为了报答昔日的恩义，\\n定要将一切统统击溃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da25ed1171356e9d97d5c615b8a43c6138f5c718793b175f4df2f71aee157467",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "1149"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e47243fd335a2e0da5a3ae1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "您好，我是特雷森学园的理事长秘书骏川手纲。\\n为了让大家能够过上更好的学园生活，\\n我会全力支援您的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "69dd42e6caeaec2788354ebf403d5ba13ab115c858b7ad0b725ae38967f3db5f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "9001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95960302b38e030f40b8b7fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是理事长秋川弥生！我将尽全力为我校学生\\n以及支援着她们的训练员们提供帮助！\\n诸位就尽情交给我吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01359ac72e3cd8d81a677285030e5320774938012bfa4f3b7786a82ca1a320ca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "9002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10c6dc2d7fb6c5ba6ddc35a1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "您好，我叫桐生院葵。\\n虽然作为特雷森学园的新人训练员还远远不够成熟，\\n但为了赛马娘们的未来，我会全力以赴加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4aa9c8f9fd6f40abba095bfc6aa4ea44345efd3387943067af1ddf956f83c11",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "9004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dd1575d4e65f6e827839b81",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是手艺精湛的笹针师（的弟子），安心泽刺刺美哦。\\n让我扎一下的话能“噗”一声增强力量！\\nWow，安～心☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4adde6b7e88c8b1597a6909bce58a9408e5dc1981fb15c4de822b51e327103a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "9005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab7b3601d00918bb99a0acb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是㭴本理子。对赛马娘健康状况的管理\\n是训练员的职责。因此对工作抱有紧张感\\n是理所当然的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec8df16f7b776f755135f018fd05df8bae047d14b2504a848acb4c66776b34c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "9006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e2948612a9e99f0eac31804",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我，是主要从事活动策划的轻柔致意。\\n请允许我为每个在舞台上闪耀的人\\n提供些许帮助吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "65ff80f28b5d2ff52bc356ff01e047da24be97a3372c0c3069f9c6bece21e7c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "163",
        "9008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7db4d802ce67fd4b4f5a2584",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是达利阿拉伯。每个赛马娘\\n都有自己的个性，每个人也都能成为主角――\\n我会悉心培育你们的，羔羊们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8df4e98fe84f3e764309881c9dfe0cc7ab5cbade201e01d153ba2f19bbc75019",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
